</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> CivMage Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

<b>Name: The Fellowship of Wizardry</b>

<b>Description:</b>
 Over the ages, many people wished to study the art of 
 wielding the forces around us. However, some were not 
 willing to make the total commitment to the use of magic
 that the Brotherhood of Wizardry requires. Thus, the 
 Fellowship of Wizardry was formed for these more casual 
 students of the art of magic.


<hr>
<b>SUMMARY (contributed by Jiriki)</b>


All poor attack spells to max at 9
All average attack spells to max at 13
All good attack spells to max at 17
All good area attack spells to max at 21
All very good attack spells to max at 25
Darkness to max at 6
Floating letters to max at 7
Floating disc to max at 10
Light to max at 6
Attack to 50% at 6
Cast generic to max at 9
Consider to max at 6
Essence eye to max at 7
Short blades to 50% at 6
Skill that saves sp to 8%
Create food to max at 8
Cast help to max at 7
Cast (damage spell) starts at 7, max at 14
Cast special to max at 12
Cast teleportation to max at 10
Skill that saves sp to max at 9
Clairvoyance to max at 13
Satiate person to max at 18
Cast information to max at 18
Heavy weight to max at 19
Identify to max at 20
See magic to max at 20
Wizard eye to max at 21
Conceal spellcasting to 50% at 25
Quick chant starts at 16, max 50% at 25
Infravision to max at 22
Cast protection to max at 22
Flip to max at 24
Mirror image to max at 25
See invisible to max at 25
Cast control to max at 24
Zapping to max at 25


<hr>


Abilities gained when joining:
 May study spell Darkness to 10%
 May study spell Light to 10%
 May study spell Magic missile to 5%
 May train skill Attack to 4%
 May train skill Cast generic to 4%
 May train skill Zapping to 12%
 Receive the Robes of Wizardry
 Receive bonus for civ mages...

<b> Level 2:</b>
  Requirements:
   Must pass 1 out of the following:
    Studied spell Light to at least 10% (at 0%)
    Studied spell Darkness to at least 10% (at 0%)
   May study spell Chill touch to 10%
   May study spell Darkness to 20%
   May study spell Disruption to 10%
   May study spell Flame arrow to 10%
   May study spell Floating letters to 15%
   May study spell Light to 20%
   May study spell Magic missile to 10%
   May study spell Shocking grasp to 10%
   May study spell Thorn spray to 10%
   May study spell Vacuumbolt to 10%
   May train skill Attack to 8%
   May train skill Cast generic to 8%
   May train skill Cast help to 12%
   May train skill Consider to 16%
   May train skill Essence eye to 12%
   May train skill Short blades to 8%
   May train skill Skill that saves sp to 8%
 <b>Level 3:</b>
   May study spell Chill touch to 20%
   May study spell Create food to 15%
   May study spell Darkness to 40%
   May study spell Disruption to 20%
   May study spell Flame arrow to 20%
   May study spell Floating letters to 30%
   May study spell Light to 40%
   May study spell Magic missile to 20%
   May study spell Shocking grasp to 20%
   May study spell Thorn spray to 20%
   May study spell Vacuumbolt to 20%
   May train skill Attack to 16%
   May train skill Cast generic to 16%
   May train skill Cast help to 24%
   May train skill Consider to 32%
   May train skill Essence eye to 24%
   May train skill Short blades to 16%
   May train skill Skill that saves sp to 16%
 <b>Level 4:</b>
  Requirements:
   Must pass 1 out of the following:
    Studied spell Chill touch to at least 20% (at 0%)
    Studied spell Disruption to at least 20% (at 0%)
    Studied spell Flame arrow to at least 20% (at 0%)
